notes.content:
NEW

+ Minimap: Shows your location and the locations of enemies.

CHANGES

+ The Advanced Spell "Elemental Shield" now deals bonus damage equal to 22% of your armor (level 3) and works with Troll's Smash;
+ The Advanced Spell "Elemental Nova" now also destroys Flying Machine bombs;
+ The Advanced Spell "Dancing Elemental Stones" now increases rotation speed based on your attack speed;
+ The Taurus Ability now destroys the Ice Boss's shield.

+ Ultimate Spell "Elemental Stones Lifting" has been improved: 
      10% armor dmg -> 10% dmg + 50% armor dmg;
+ Leaderboard bug fixed.

LEADERBOARD IMPROVED: 

+ High scores are now saved in the cloud, not locally;
+ The leaderboard now shows which dragon the player used to achieve that score;
+ The leaderboard can now be accessed at any time from the game's main menu;
+ The leaderboard has been reset.

BALANCING

+ The uncommon card "Long Blow" now has a maximum stack limit of 4;
+ When you get an ultimate by upgrading a basic attack to level 3, the ultimate already comes at maximum level, instead of coming at level 1.

+ Archers have been drastically nerfed: they no longer receive attack speed bonuses and no longer launch 3 arrows simultaneously in distant waves, reducing the "Bullet Hell" feel;
+ Troll Riders have been buffed: they are now immune to crowd control and deal much more damage;
+ Improved death system: now, when you die, information about what killed you is displayed.

[h1]CHANGES[/h1]

+ Bosses start at wave 5;
+ The next two waves after the bosses are non-elemental (normal forest), allowing the player to breathe and prepare for the next elemental environment;
+ Visual and sound effects of spells have been smoothed out, reducing visual and sound pollution when casting multiple spells at once;
+ The 'Flying Machine' enemy has been adjusted (it can no longer be pushed by the player and throws bombs in the player's direction).

+ New epic card by stacking 4 'CLOSE COMBAT';
+ Now player and enemies [b]blink [/b]when taking damage, improving the damage feeling;
+ Damage texts above characters last for less time, reducing visual clutter;
+ Advanced Spell 'ELEMENTAL FORM' has been improved: now the base speed during the form has increased significantly, and in addition, the speed increases even more if the spell is used with the same element as the current environment.

CHANGES

+ ICE INTRINSIC PASSIVE: Now the shards are also launched at random enemies, dealing 2% dmg, each. Deals double dmg if the target is frozen. This change allows the player to make an ice build focused on damage now.
+ ANGER FAIRY: Now she attacks random enemies.

EXTRA EFFECTS FOR SOME DRAGONS ABILITIES

+ LIBRA DRAGON: now also gives 1 extra POWER card or 1 extra HARDER SCALES card every time you get one of these;
+ TAURUS DRAGON: now also gives 1 armor every time you take damage (+400) (resets every wave);
+ CANCER DRAGON: now also heals full stamina and 50% of your HP when your health drops below 15%, once per wave;
+ GEMINI DRAGON: now also gives 1 random fairy card every time you defeat a boss.

These dragons retain their previous abilities, but with these additional effects.

BALANCING

+ Rare 'HARDER SCALES' cards now give +80 armor instead of +60;
+ ARIES DRAGON now has a maximum limit of +300%.

CHANGES

+ Collision with trees removed;
+ Issue with abrupt stop at the end of the dash fixed;
+ Stamina cost for flying has been reduced;
+ Stamina recovery while on the ground has been increased;
+ You can now land on rocks.

+ Bug fixes;
+ Shadow fixes;
+ Adjustments to the lighting of the scene and boss abilities;
+ Adjustments to the balance of humans in more distant waves.

NEW SKILL SYSTEM

The old system of equipping skills in slots was replaced by a new system, more faithful to the roguelite genre, which consists of obtaining random skills during the game, which do not remain after death.

ELEMENTAL ASPECTS

All skills gained aspects for each element, considerably increasing the options (example: The tornado can be chosen as a fire, ice, darkness, lightning, wind or earth tornado. This applies to all skills in the game) . When choosing an elemental dragon form in the home menu, all skills in the game will have that elemental aspect.

NEW CONTROLS

The old movement and skill controls have been changed. Now, the dragon's movement is performed in A, W, S, D and its abilities are used in J, K, L, U, I, O. Additionally, ultimate abilities are now cast instantly, without the need to charge .

BUGS FIXES

Several bugs were fixed, including the bug where survival against fatal damage from elemental forms did not work.

REMOVAL OF CARDS

Swiftness and Ultimate Fury cards have been removed from the game.

BUFFS, NERFS AND CHANGES

 *The SKELETAL DRAGON form has been improved;
 *The FROST BEAM skill and its aspects have been improved;
 *The ICE WAVE skill and its aspects have undergone changes;
 *The FREEZING SCALES skill and its aspects have undergone changes;
 *DISCHARGE skill has been improved;
 *The STATIC SHOCK passive has been improved;
 *The INTELLIGENCE, FAST SHOOTING and HARDER SCALES cards have been improved;
 *Now only 8 FAST SHOOTING cards can be obtained;
 *Now only 1 FEAR FAIRY card can be obtained;
 *Now the dragon will have an initial basic health regeneration, even without any cards
 CICATRIZATION.

* Environment Blasts now appear only on boss waves;
* Changed the user interface (Skills tab in the main menu);
* Additional magic effect around the dragon when charging ultimate;
* Arrival of elemental Morphs;
* Can now be Morphed: Fireball, Frost Beam, Lightning Chain and Tornado.

* Added Environment Blasts;
* Meteor Summoning Fixed;
* Projectiles increase forward speed as attack speed increases;
* Nerfed Rage Bar;
* Small fixes.

* New rage bar system;
* New cards: FRAGMENTATION, MAGNETIC SKIN and SHORT TEMPER;
* Visual improvements;
* Small fixes.

